@startuml
title Distributed systems - foundations

class "What changes" as C1 {
  No shared memory, clock, or failure
}
class "Failure models" as C2 {
  Crash-stop to Byzantine
}
class "Logical time" as C3 {
  Happens-before, no real clocks
}
class "Consistency spectrum" as C4 {
  Strong vs eventual (CAP/PACELC)
}
class "Replication & quorums" as C5 {
  R + W > N
}
class "Agreement (consensus)" as C6 {
  Nodes agree on one value (Raft)
}
class "Delivery & retries" as C7 {
  At-least-once + idempotency
}

C1 --> C2 : leads to
C2 --> C3
C3 --> C4
C4 --> C5
C5 --> C6
C6 --> C7
@enduml